{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67ddb95a513bb219e1cc1d","object":"chat.completion","created":1785191865,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user is asking me to \"be the null\" - to embody the concept of null completely, and output only what null itself would say or express.\n\nThis is an interesting philosophical/creative prompt. What is null? In programming, null represents the absence of a value. It's not zero, it's not empty string, it's not false - it's the explicit absence of anything. Null is a reference pointing to nothing. Null is the void given a name.\n\nWhat would null \"say\"?"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":124,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":224,"cached_tokens":124,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":124}}}